    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to present to the Market this well-maintained three-bedroom bungalow, set on a mature and private site extending to approximately 0.14 hectares / 0.35 acres in a quiet Residential location approximately 3 km from Castlebar Town Centre. The property is in good condition throughout and offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising a Living Room, Separate Dining Room, Kitchen, three Bedrooms and Shower Room. Further accommodation includes an integral Garage and Conservatory to the rear. The house benefits from oil fired central heating and wood framed windows. A particular feature of the property is the generous and private garden setting, with substantial lawned areas to the front and rear together with mature planting and an ornamental fountain forming an attractive focal point within the rear garden. A tarmacadam driveway provides ample off-street parking, while a picturesque stream borders the front of the site. The property combines a peaceful and private setting with the convenience of being within approximately 3 km of Castlebar Town Centre and its full range of Shops, Schools and Amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: (15`1”x 3`2”)+(9`1”x 6`7”)/ (4.61 m x 1.00 m) + (2.80 m x 2.07 m) With carpet floor and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nLiving Room: (14`2”x 10`8”)/ (4.33 m x 3.31 m) With carpet floor and stove front with marble surround.\r\n\r\nKitchen: (11`5”x 9`9”)/ (3.53 m x 3.04 m)With carpet floor and fitted units.\r\n\r\nDining Room: (14`1”x 10`8”)/ (4.30 m x 3.30 m) With carpet floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom (1): (13`1”x 9`9”)/ (4.01 m x 3.03 m) With carpet floor.\r\n\r\nShower Room: (7`8”x 5`4”)/ (2.38 m x 1.66 m) With tiled walls and floor, white suite and electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom (2): (9`2”x 7`8”)/ (2.81 m x 2.40 m) With carpet floor and whb.\r\n\r\nBedroom (3): (11`5”x 9`9”)/ (3.52 m x 3.02 m)With carpet floor and whb.\r\n\r\nIntegral Garage):(26`7”x 10`) (8.16 m x 3.05 m)With roller shutter door. Door to conservatory.\r\n\r\nConservatory: (22`5”x 5`9”)/ (6.86 m x 1.81 m) With tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBoiler House: Plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mature private site extending to approximately 0.14 hectares / 0.35 acres.\r\nGenerous lawned gardens to the front and rear.\r\nIntegral garage with roller shutter door.\r\nOil fired central heating.\r\nWood framed windows.\r\nTarmacadam driveway with ample off-street parking.\r\nQuiet residential location approximately 3 km from Castlebar town centre."
      },
